xmodel/block-descent-a1-rank4-mm-identity-hostile-review-sol56-20260831.md:13:I treated the first packet as the object under review, the second only as its declared provisional source interface for Orevkov/Chau, and the third only as the promotion-status hierarchy. I did not inspect `jc2-lean`, alter a charged input or canonical ledger, or promote any statement. All computations below are exact desk computations.
