+## 3. The `N = 6` Witness
+
+Let
+
+```text
+H(x,y) = (x,z),        z = x y^3 - y,
+psi_e(u,v) = (u+v^e,v),
+T(u,v) = (u,v^2),
+F_k = T o psi_e o H,  e = 2k+1.
+```
+
+So `F_k=(x+z^e,z^2)`.  Since `T` is finite, it is proper, and
+
+```text
