+At the cusp `p_0=(0,0)`, the only fold preimage is `(0,0)`, and the source
+equations force `x=0`, `y=0`.  Thus `a_{p_0}=1`, `r_{p_0}=1`, and MPRIME's
+fibre law gives
+
+```text
