+(C1)        r W = 2 <= 6 at the unibranch cusp.
+(C2)        unibranch points only have K_p <= a; here 3 <= 4.
+(C3)        #{K_p>0}=1 <= R+beta = 0+1.
+7.B'        mu = 2.
+```
